<title>USA: NICOR to buy back $50 mln of its shares.</title>
<headline>NICOR to buy back $50 mln of its shares.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>NICOR Inc said Wednesday its board authorized the repurchase of $50 million of the company's shares.  </p>
<p>The purchases will be made as market conditions permit through open market transactions and to the extent cash flow is available after other investment opportunities, NICOR said.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
